                473,
                151
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "《诗经·周南》"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                337,
                172,
                473,
                193
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "content": {
                "list_type": "text_list",
                "attribute": "unordered",
                "list_items": [
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "采采<sup>b</sup> 芣苢，薄言<sup>c</sup> 采之。采采芣苢，薄言有<sup>d</sup> 之。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "采采芣苢，薄言掇<sup>e</sup> 之。采采芣苢，薄言捋<sup>f</sup> 之。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "采采芣苢，薄言袺<sup>g</sup> 之。采采芣苢，薄言襭<sup>h</sup> 之。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                246,
                638,
                318
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "插秧歌 <sup>i</sup>"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                341,
                393,
                473,
                425
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "杨万里"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                371,
                448,
                438,
                467
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "田夫抛秧田妇接，小儿拔秧大儿插。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                226,
                521,
                549,
                542
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "笠是兜鍪<sup>j</sup> 蓑是甲，雨从头上湿到胛<sup>k</sup>。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                226,
                546,
                581,
                568
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "唤渠<sup>l</sup> 朝餐歇半霎<sup>m</sup>，低头折腰只不答："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                226,
                571,
                581,
                592
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "“秧根未牢莳未匝<sup>n</sup>，照管<sup>o</sup> 鹅儿与雏鸭。”"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                226,
                595,
                601,
                618
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "a 选自《诗经注析》（中华书局1991年版）。芣苢（fúyǐ），车前草。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                750,
                478,
                787
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "b〔采采〕茂盛的样子。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                785,
                278,
                804
            ]
        },
