                        "content": "g〔袺（jié）〕提起衣襟兜东西。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                876,
                334,
                894
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "h〔襭（xié）〕把衣襟掖在腰带上兜东西。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                894,
